 What Does “Done” Mean?"]},{"id":"vocab-this-part-is-working","en":"This part is working.","zh":"准确限定已完成的部分","sources":["有声书 · What Does “Done” Mean?"]},{"id":"vocab-the-review-is-still-outstanding","en":"The review is still outstanding.","zh":"说明审查仍未完成","sources":["有声书 · What Does “Done” Mean?"]},{"id":"vocab-i-can-connect-it-but-i-need-time-to-check-it","en":"I can connect it, but I need time to check it.","zh":"区分实现与验证所需时间","sources":["有声书 · What Does “Done” Mean?"]},{"id":"vocab-let-s-write-the-criteria-down","en":"Let’s write the criteria down.","zh":"把验收口径记录下来","sources":["有声书 · What Does “Done” Mean?"]},{"id":"vocab-which-time-zone-do-you-mean","en":"Which time zone do you mean?","zh":"确认时区","sources":["有声书 · Friday, Which Friday?"]},{"id":"vocab-do-you-mean-this-friday-or-next-friday","en":"Do you mean this Friday or next Friday?","zh":"区分本周五与下周五","sources":["有声书 · Friday, Which Friday?"]},{"id":"vocab-let-me-confirm-both-dates","en":"Let me confirm both dates.","zh":"汇总两个日期以供核对","sources":["有声书 · Friday, Which Friday?"]},{"id":"vocab-this-is-a-demonstration-not-a-launch","en":"This is a demonstration, not a launch.","zh":"明确演示的用途边界","sources":["有声书 · Friday, Which Friday?"]},{"id":"vocab-i-m-available-until-six","en":"I’m available until six.","zh":"说明可用时间的截止点","sources":["有声书 · Friday, Which Friday?"]},{"id":"vocab-the-request-is-being-refused","en":"The request is being refused.","zh":"描述客观失败现象","sources":["有声书 · The Update"]},{"id":"vocab-here-s-what-i-ve-checked","en":"Here’s what I’ve checked.","zh":"汇报已排查的事实","sources":["有声书 · The Update"]},{"id":"vocab-we-can-continue-with-local-data","en":"We can continue with local data.","zh":"说明尚可推进的工作","sources":["有声书 · The Update"]},{"id":"vocab-i-can-t-promise-that-until-we-know-the-cause","en":"I can’t promise that until we know the cause.","zh":"说明承诺依赖的前提","sources":["有声书 · The Update"]},{"id":"vocab-i-should-have-raised-this-sooner","en":"I should have raised this sooner.","zh":"承认未及时报告","sources":["有声书 · T